OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining showers will soon fade this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving a dry night with
OL,8,Fclear spells for many. Breezy
OL,9,Finitially but winds gradually easing
OL,10,Fas the night progresses. Becoming
OL,11,Fchilly, especially in prone rural
OL,12,Fspots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,15,Fto Wednesday, but becoming
OL,16,Fincreasingly cloudy from late morning,
OL,17,Fthough remaining dry. Becoming windy
OL,18,Fby the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
