OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain Thursday,
OL,7,Fclearing overnight. Sunny spells and
OL,8,Fshowers Friday, with showers largely
OL,9,Fbecoming confined to the coast on
OL,10,FSaturday. Mild Thursday, otherwise
OL,11,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
